+data, then set the cap." Add a regression: `budget_usd` set + empty JSONL +
+Claude-backed stub → the runner aborts before the FIRST dispatch (stub called 0
+times), returns non-zero, prints the actionable message. Keep the existing
+per-invocation mid-run abort behavior once an estimate exists.
 
